l":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#security-notes","content":"Bazel runfiles + explicit data dependencies make exactly what is needed visible (no accidental leakage of host files)."},"144":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-142","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#security-notes","content":"`MODULE.bazel.lock` is committed (standard for reproducible Bzlmod) and contains only public registry metadata."},"145":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-143","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#security-notes","content":"See the root `.gitignore` and `.bazelignore` for the full exclusion list."},"146":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-144","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#current-bazel-coverage","content":"The following are modeled with first-class Bazel targets:"},"147":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-145","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#current-bazel-coverage","content":"`//:manage` as `sh_binary` (`//:manage`)"},"148":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-146","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#current-bazel-coverage","content":"Full hermetic BATS suite (vendored bats-core)"},"149":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-147","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#current-bazel-coverage","content":"Kubernetes manifests and overlays as `filegroup` data"},"150":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-148","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#current-bazel-coverage","content