e-b-and-mode-c","content":"200 Gb/s per physical port (not NVLink, not InfiniBand switch). Triangle mesh: every pair has a direct cable."},"1202":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-33","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#3-node-qsfp-ring-mode-b-and-mode-c","content":"Port0 = cage next to the RJ-45 jack; Port1 = far cage. Wrong polarity looks half-alive and dies in NCCL. MTU 9000 on CX-7. All four CX-7 netdevs per node need IPs (six unique /24s). Confirm live names with `ibdev2netdev` before baking env."},"1203":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-34","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#3-node-qsfp-ring-mode-b-and-mode-c","content":"**Mode B / Mode C NCCL** (these Jobs only — do not copy 2-node pair vars):"},"1204":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-35","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#3-node-qsfp-ring-mode-b-and-mode-c","content":"If 10GbE is not `enP7s7`, set `LAB_MGMT_IFNAME`. Do not hard-fail the stack on that string. `ansible/inventory/group_vars/all.yml` `highspeed_*` is the **2-node pair** reference."},"1205":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-36","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#3-node-qsfp-ring-mode-b-and-mode-c","content":"K3s/Flannel stay on the LAN. Mode B and Mode C Jobs use `hostNetwork: true` and `hostIPC: true`. Realistic ring bus is \\~12–24 GB/s allgather. Optional GB10 UMA livelock fallback (not default): `NCCL_NET_GDR_LEVEL=0`. Mode C also sets NCCL buffer cuts (`NCCL_BUFFSIZE=1MiB`) so pinned host RAM does not eat the head."},"1206":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-37","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Node"},"1207":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-38","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Job"},"1208":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-39","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Checkpoint"},"1209":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-40","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Aliases"},"1210":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-41","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"spark0"},"1211":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-42","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"existing `qwen3.6-35b-a3b-nvfp4`"},"1212":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-43","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Unsloth N