** — `kubectl port-forward` to `127.0.0.1:8000` (managed by `hermes-stack`)"],[5925,"**Intent**: GB10 has no user-controllable power limit or fan curve on DGX Spark\n(`nvidia-smi -pl` and fan speed return N/A). The only operator-accessible actuator\nis graphics clock locking via `nvidia-smi -lgc`. Range lock (default 300–2200 MHz)\ncaps peak clocks to avoid sustained 78–88°C temps and thermal shutdowns during\nlong-running inference, with near-zero impact on memory-bound MoE workloads."],[5942,"**Intent**: Keep \\~/.ollama/models in sync across the two nodes for dev/experiments\nwithout re-downloading large models. Uses the high-speed interconnect links when possible."],[5952,"**Intent**: Keep base OS (apt dist-upgrade) and firmware (fwupdmgr) current.\nCRITICAL LAB SAFETY: Never reboot while heavy inference workloads are running.\nAlways stop jobs first (manage.sh stop) and verify clean before reboot."],[5775,"**Intent**: Let operators toggle heavy dev tooling on/off under tight cluster\nresources without using stop-dev (which removes the whole dev stack)."],[5839,"**Intent**: Resumable, verified download of the 1-bit dynamic quant GGUF shards to shared model storage."],[2415,"**Intentional exceptions** (not polyglot source — dual representation or platform-native):"],[940,"**Job**"],[919,"**K3s**"],[1085,"**Kasm:** Custom desktop image `spark-lab-kasm-desktop:1.19.0` autostarts the gateway on session launch."],[3865,"**Kasm** — streamed desktop/apps in the browser."],[519,"**Kasm**: Additional flexibility for containerized or desktop sessions streamed to browser."],[4777,"**kimi-test**"],[1141,"**kimi-test** (`start-test`) — always before heavy Jobs"],[4781,"**kimi**"],[1662,"**kube-state-metrics**"],[2281,"**Kubeconfig:** auto-sets `KUBECONFIG` if `${REPO_ROOT}/kubeconfig/config` exists"],[3016,"**kubelet reservation** reduces schedulable CPU/RAM; protects sshd/k3s from OOM"],[2978,"**Kubernetes** — `k8s/base/resource-guard/` (PriorityClass, ResourceQuota, LimitR